window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b281-a2f5da51dd2898b8.json"]={sha256:"a2f5da51dd2898b866e6507fb223320cbce5936f2275a95d553d45aedcf40898",value:{"id":"b281","title":"海堤越波模型試驗","titleEn":"Overtopping model tests for seawalls","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以尺度相似、波列統計與量測鏈判讀海堤越波模型。課程從邊界辨識與資料整理走到水理量化、構造介面及驗證紀錄；每一步把計算結果連回可量測的證據。十個不同單元分別處理關鍵機制，不以名義尺寸或單一通過率代替整體工程判斷，並明列合成算例與現地資料的差別。","summaryEn":"Interpret seawall overtopping tests through scale similarity, wave statistics and measurement chains. The course moves from boundary identification and evidence to hydraulic quantification, structural interfaces and verification records. Ten distinct units connect each calculated quantity to measurable evidence. Nominal geometry or a single pass rate does not establish whole-system performance, and synthetic teaching examples remain separate from field observations.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-coasts","subcategoryTitle":"海岸、港灣與水資源韌性","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coasts, ports and water-resource resilience","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-coasts","learningTags":["water","water-coasts","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-coast","architectureNodes":[["弗勞德縮尺條件","Froude scaling conditions"],["集水控制體積","Collection control volume"],["相對出水高度","Relative crest freeboard"],["取樣頻帶配置","Sampling bandwidth selection"],["局部荷載與平均量","Local load versus mean flow"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-coast","labels":["弗勞德縮尺條件","集水控制體積","相對出水高度","取樣頻帶配置","局部荷載與平均量"],"labelsEn":["Froude scaling conditions","Collection control volume","Relative crest freeboard","Sampling bandwidth selection","Local load versus mean flow"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"以下為原創合成算例，不是地標工程的實測或推薦操作值。教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設原型對模型長度比25，原型波高5m、週期10s，模型為0.20m與10/√25=2s；只採重力相似。假設長度比由25增10%為27.5，固定原型週期10s時模型週期由2降為1.9069s，下降約4.65%；不能把時間也直接縮小10%。重新計算前先列固定條件、單位、適用尺度及可能失效的邊界。把模型敏感度與測量誤差分開，不能將單一參數變化直接當成工程風險或壽命比例。比較兩次結果後，記錄還需要哪些獨立證據，並由負責專業人員判斷適用性。","textEn":"This original synthetic example is neither a landmark measurement nor a recommended operating value. Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume prototype:model length ratio25, prototype height5m and period10s. Model height is0.20m and period10/√25=2s under gravity similarity only. Increasing length ratio from25 to27.5 by10% at fixed prototype period10s changes model period from2 to1.9069s, about4.65% lower; time does not change by10%. Before recalculating, list fixed conditions, units, applicable scale and boundaries that could fail. Separate model sensitivity from measurement uncertainty: a parameter change does not directly give a proportional change in engineering risk or service life. Compare the results, record independent evidence still needed, and have the responsible specialist determine applicability.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b281-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「弗勞德縮尺條件」與「單寬流量換算」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Froude scaling conditions\" and \"Unit-discharge conversion\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b281-v15-01","title":"弗勞德縮尺條件：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Froude scaling conditions: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「弗勞德縮尺條件」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Froude scaling conditions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"重力主導的自由液面試驗可保持弗勞德相似，使速度與時間按長度平方根縮放。黏滯、表面張力和含氣衝擊卻不能同時自動相似，縮小到細小水舌時必須重新檢查主導機制，避免只憑幾何比例接受模型。 假設原型對模型長度比25，原型波高5m、週期10s，模型為0.20m與10/√25=2s；只採重力相似。 空氣可壓縮性與液滴破裂對縮尺的反應不同，須分開選擇可外推的觀察量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「弗勞德縮尺條件」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Gravity-dominated free-surface tests can preserve Froude similarity, scaling velocity and time with the square root of length. Viscosity, surface tension and aerated impacts do not automatically remain similar; a thin model water tongue may therefore change the dominant physics despite geometrically accurate construction. Assume prototype:model length ratio25, prototype height5m and period10s. Model height is0.20m and period10/√25=2s under gravity similarity only. Air compressibility and droplet breakup respond differently to scaling, requiring separate decisions about which observations can be extrapolated. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Froude scaling conditions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「弗勞德縮尺條件」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Froude scaling conditions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-01-k1","title":"弗勞德縮尺條件","titleEn":"Froude scaling conditions","text":"重力主導的自由液面試驗可保持弗勞德相似，使速度與時間按長度平方根縮放。黏滯、表面張力和含氣衝擊卻不能同時自動相似，縮小到細小水舌時必須重新檢查主導機制，避免只憑幾何比例接受模型。","textEn":"Gravity-dominated free-surface tests can preserve Froude similarity, scaling velocity and time with the square root of length. Viscosity, surface tension and aerated impacts do not automatically remain similar; a thin model water tongue may therefore change the dominant physics despite geometrically accurate construction.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「弗勞德縮尺條件」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Froude scaling conditions\" is correct?","options":["長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。","重力主導的自由液面試驗可保持弗勞德相似，使速度與時間按長度平方根縮放。","單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。"],"optionsEn":["Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar.","Gravity-dominated free-surface tests can preserve Froude similarity, scaling velocity and time with the square root of length.","Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent."],"answer":1,"explanation":"重力主導的自由液面試驗可保持弗勞德相似，使速度與時間按長度平方根縮放。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Gravity-dominated free-surface tests can preserve Froude similarity, scaling velocity and time with the square root of length. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b281-v15-02","title":"弗勞德縮尺條件：定量估算","titleEn":"Froude scaling conditions: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「弗勞德縮尺條件」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Froude scaling conditions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設原型對模型長度比25，原型波高5m、週期10s，模型為0.20m與10/√25=2s；只採重力相似。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume prototype:model length ratio25, prototype height5m and period10s. Model height is0.20m and period10/√25=2s under gravity similarity only. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設原型對模型長度比25，原型波高5m、週期10s，模型為0.20m與10/√25=2s；只採重力相似。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume prototype:model length ratio25, prototype height5m and period10s. Model height is0.20m and period10/√25=2s under gravity similarity only.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「弗勞德縮尺條件」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Froude scaling conditions\", which statement holds?","options":["最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。","反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height.","Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b281-v15-03","title":"弗勞德縮尺條件：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Froude scaling conditions: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「弗勞德縮尺條件」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Froude scaling conditions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。比較不同縮尺的關鍵輸出，記錄哪種現象不能由單一重力相似支持外推。另列模型最小水深與最大流速。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed. Compare critical outputs at different scales and record phenomena for which gravity similarity alone cannot justify extrapolation. Also tabulate minimum model depth and maximum flow speed. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。比較不同縮尺的關鍵輸出，記錄哪種現象不能由單一重力相似支持外推。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed. Compare critical outputs at different scales and record phenomena for which gravity similarity alone cannot justify extrapolation.","failure":"注意干擾：若模型小到表面張力控制薄層水流，堤頂濺水與集水比例便可能偏離原型；幾何尺寸全部合格仍無法消除這種尺度效應，放大結果也不會自動恢復真實物理。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If surface tension dominates thin model flow, crest splashing and collected fractions differ from the prototype. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。比較不同縮尺的關鍵輸出，記錄哪種現象不能由單一重力相似支持外推。另列模型最小水深與最大流速。","textEn":"Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed. Compare critical outputs at different scales and record phenomena for which gravity similarity alone cannot justify extrapolation. Also tabulate minimum model depth and maximum flow speed.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。比較不同縮尺的關鍵輸出，記錄哪種現象不能由單一重力相似支持外推。","textEn":"Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed. Compare critical outputs at different scales and record phenomena for which gravity similarity alone cannot justify extrapolation.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「弗勞德縮尺條件」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Froude scaling conditions\"?","options":["製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。"],"optionsEn":["Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access."],"answer":0,"explanation":"製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b281-v15-04","title":"弗勞德縮尺條件：失效診斷","titleEn":"Froude scaling conditions: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「弗勞德縮尺條件」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Froude scaling conditions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若模型小到表面張力控制薄層水流，堤頂濺水與集水比例便可能偏離原型；幾何尺寸全部合格仍無法消除這種尺度效應，放大結果也不會自動恢復真實物理。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If surface tension dominates thin model flow, crest splashing and collected fractions differ from the prototype. Accurate geometry cannot eliminate that scale effect, and multiplying the result does not restore the missing physics. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：空氣可壓縮性與液滴破裂對縮尺的反應不同，須分開選擇可外推的觀察量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Air compressibility and droplet breakup respond differently to scaling, requiring separate decisions about which observations can be extrapolated.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若模型小到表面張力控制薄層水流，堤頂濺水與集水比例便可能偏離原型；幾何尺寸全部合格仍無法消除這種尺度效應，放大結果也不會自動恢復真實物理。","textEn":"If surface tension dominates thin model flow, crest splashing and collected fractions differ from the prototype. Accurate geometry cannot eliminate that scale effect, and multiplying the result does not restore the missing physics.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「弗勞德縮尺條件」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Froude scaling conditions\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若模型小到表面張力控制薄層水流，堤頂濺水與集水比例便可能偏離原型；幾何尺寸全部合格仍無法消除這種尺度效應，放大結果也不會自動恢復真實物理。","單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","If surface tension dominates thin model flow, crest splashing and collected fractions differ from the prototype.","Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若模型小到表面張力控制薄層水流，堤頂濺水與集水比例便可能偏離原型；幾何尺寸全部合格仍無法消除這種尺度效應，放大結果也不會自動恢復真實物理。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If surface tension dominates thin model flow, crest splashing and collected fractions differ from the prototype. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b281-v15-05","title":"單寬流量換算：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Unit-discharge conversion: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「單寬流量換算」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Unit-discharge conversion” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"單寬越波流量的量綱是面積除時間，與整條海堤的總流量不同。重力相似下它按長度比的二分之三次方縮放，先辨清是否已除試驗寬度，才能避免額外乘一次長度比例造成嚴重誤差。 假設長度比25、模型q=0.0004m²/s，原型q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m；不代表人員容許值。 若沿堤方向越波不均，單一收集段也不能代表整條堤線的流量分布。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「單寬流量換算」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Unit-width overtopping discharge has dimensions of area per time and differs from total flow across a seawall. Under gravity similarity it scales with length to the three-halves power. Determine whether the measured quantity has already been divided by width before applying a second width conversion. Assume length ratio25 and model q=0.0004m²/s. Prototype q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m, not a pedestrian tolerance. Spatially uneven overtopping means one collector segment cannot represent the discharge distribution along the entire seawall. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Unit-discharge conversion” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「單寬流量換算」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Unit-discharge conversion”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-05-k1","title":"單寬流量換算","titleEn":"Unit-discharge conversion","text":"單寬越波流量的量綱是面積除時間，與整條海堤的總流量不同。重力相似下它按長度比的二分之三次方縮放，先辨清是否已除試驗寬度，才能避免額外乘一次長度比例造成嚴重誤差。","textEn":"Unit-width overtopping discharge has dimensions of area per time and differs from total flow across a seawall. Under gravity similarity it scales with length to the three-halves power.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「單寬流量換算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Unit-discharge conversion\" is correct?","options":["單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。","收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。","單寬越波流量的量綱是面積除時間，與整條海堤的總流量不同。"],"optionsEn":["Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent.","A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.","Unit-width overtopping discharge has dimensions of area per time and differs from total flow across a seawall."],"answer":2,"explanation":"單寬越波流量的量綱是面積除時間，與整條海堤的總流量不同。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Unit-width overtopping discharge has dimensions of area per time and differs from total flow across a seawall. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b281-v15-06","title":"單寬流量換算：定量估算","titleEn":"Unit-discharge conversion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「單寬流量換算」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Unit-discharge conversion” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設長度比25、模型q=0.0004m²/s，原型q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m；不代表人員容許值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume length ratio25 and model q=0.0004m²/s. Prototype q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m, not a pedestrian tolerance. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設長度比25、模型q=0.0004m²/s，原型q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m；不代表人員容許值。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume length ratio25 and model q=0.0004m²/s. Prototype q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m, not a pedestrian tolerance.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「單寬流量換算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Unit-discharge conversion\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。","每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping.","Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b281-v15-07","title":"單寬流量換算：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Unit-discharge conversion: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「單寬流量換算」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Unit-discharge conversion” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。再由另一人從基本量綱重建換算，確認圖表與資料檔的單位一致。再由單寬量反算收集段總量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately. Have another reviewer reconstruct the conversion from dimensions and check that plots and exported tables use identical units. Reconstruct total collected-section flow from the unit-width result. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。再由另一人從基本量綱重建換算，確認圖表與資料檔的單位一致。","observationEn":"Site practice: Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately. Have another reviewer reconstruct the conversion from dimensions and check that plots and exported tables use identical units.","failure":"注意干擾：若把單寬量再按全流量的尺度放大，結果會系統性偏高；反向混用則可能低估外水負荷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Scaling a unit-width quantity as total flow creates systematic overestimation; the reverse can understate loading. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。再由另一人從基本量綱重建換算，確認圖表與資料檔的單位一致。再由單寬量反算收集段總量。","textEn":"Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately. Have another reviewer reconstruct the conversion from dimensions and check that plots and exported tables use identical units. Reconstruct total collected-section flow from the unit-width result.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。再由另一人從基本量綱重建換算，確認圖表與資料檔的單位一致。","textEn":"Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately. Have another reviewer reconstruct the conversion from dimensions and check that plots and exported tables use identical units.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「單寬流量換算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Unit-discharge conversion\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。","重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately.","Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b281-v15-08","title":"單寬流量換算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Unit-discharge conversion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「單寬流量換算」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Unit-discharge conversion” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把單寬量再按全流量的尺度放大，結果會系統性偏高；反向混用則可能低估外水負荷。圖表數值看似合理時，單位錯誤仍可一路傳入排水需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Scaling a unit-width quantity as total flow creates systematic overestimation; the reverse can understate loading. Plausible-looking plots may carry the unit error directly into drainage estimates unless the original dimensions remain visible. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若沿堤方向越波不均，單一收集段也不能代表整條堤線的流量分布。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Spatially uneven overtopping means one collector segment cannot represent the discharge distribution along the entire seawall.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把單寬量再按全流量的尺度放大，結果會系統性偏高；反向混用則可能低估外水負荷。圖表數值看似合理時，單位錯誤仍可一路傳入排水需求。","textEn":"Scaling a unit-width quantity as total flow creates systematic overestimation; the reverse can understate loading. Plausible-looking plots may carry the unit error directly into drainage estimates unless the original dimensions remain visible.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「單寬流量換算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Unit-discharge conversion\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。","若把單寬量再按全流量的尺度放大，結果會系統性偏高；反向混用則可能低估外水負荷。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.","Scaling a unit-width quantity as total flow creates systematic overestimation; the reverse can understate loading."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若把單寬量再按全流量的尺度放大，結果會系統性偏高；反向混用則可能低估外水負荷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Scaling a unit-width quantity as total flow creates systematic overestimation; the reverse can understate loading. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b281-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「集水控制體積」與「不規則波能量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Collection control volume\" and \"Irregular-wave energy\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b281-v15-09","title":"集水控制體積：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Collection control volume: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「集水控制體積」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Collection control volume” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"集水裝置量到的是進入特定容器的水，不一定等於全部跨越堤頂的水。側漏、濺出、槽內滯留與試驗結束後延遲排水都會破壞收支；控制體積及起訖時刻應先定義，再討論平均越波量。 假設收集V=0.030m³、有效寬B=0.50m、時間120s，q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s；僅在收支閉合時成立。 計量解析度在低越波情境尤其重要，小讀值可能與容器零點漂移相當。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「集水控制體積」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A collection device measures water entering a particular container, not necessarily everything crossing the crest. Side leakage, splash loss, storage and delayed drainage disrupt the balance. Define the control volume and start/end times before interpreting the measurement as mean overtopping discharge. Assume collected V=0.030m³, effective B=0.50m and duration120s. q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s applies only to a closed collection balance. Meter resolution becomes especially important at low overtopping, where the collected increment may resemble tank zero drift. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Collection control volume” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「集水控制體積」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Collection control volume”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-09-k1","title":"集水控制體積","titleEn":"Collection control volume","text":"集水裝置量到的是進入特定容器的水，不一定等於全部跨越堤頂的水。側漏、濺出、槽內滯留與試驗結束後延遲排水都會破壞收支；控制體積及起訖時刻應先定義，再討論平均越波量。","textEn":"A collection device measures water entering a particular container, not necessarily everything crossing the crest. Side leakage, splash loss, storage and delayed drainage disrupt the balance.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「集水控制體積」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Collection control volume\" is correct?","options":["集水裝置量到的是進入特定容器的水，不一定等於全部跨越堤頂的水。","收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。","最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。"],"optionsEn":["A collection device measures water entering a particular container, not necessarily everything crossing the crest.","A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.","Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height."],"answer":0,"explanation":"集水裝置量到的是進入特定容器的水，不一定等於全部跨越堤頂的水。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A collection device measures water entering a particular container, not necessarily everything crossing the crest. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b281-v15-10","title":"集水控制體積：定量估算","titleEn":"Collection control volume: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「集水控制體積」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Collection control volume” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設收集V=0.030m³、有效寬B=0.50m、時間120s，q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s；僅在收支閉合時成立。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume collected V=0.030m³, effective B=0.50m and duration120s. q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s applies only to a closed collection balance. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設收集V=0.030m³、有效寬B=0.50m、時間120s，q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s；僅在收支閉合時成立。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume collected V=0.030m³, effective B=0.50m and duration120s. q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s applies only to a closed collection balance.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「集水控制體積」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Collection control volume\", which statement holds?","options":["反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。"],"optionsEn":["Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b281-v15-11","title":"集水控制體積：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Collection control volume: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「集水控制體積」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Collection control volume” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。以另一種流量或重量量測交叉檢查，保留零越波與低於檢出限的區別。用空白試驗量化容器零點漂移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage. Cross-check by weight or independent flow measurement and distinguish zero overtopping from values below detection limits. Quantify collector zero drift through a blank test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。以另一種流量或重量量測交叉檢查，保留零越波與低於檢出限的區別。","observationEn":"Site practice: Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage. Cross-check by weight or independent flow measurement and distinguish zero overtopping from values below detection limits.","failure":"注意干擾：狹窄收集槽可能漏掉斜向越波，餘水又可能被算到下一組試驗；這兩種偏差可互相抵銷，使平均值看似穩定，卻無法支持不同斷面的可靠比較。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A narrow collector can miss oblique discharge while retained water enters the next test. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。以另一種流量或重量量測交叉檢查，保留零越波與低於檢出限的區別。用空白試驗量化容器零點漂移。","textEn":"Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage. Cross-check by weight or independent flow measurement and distinguish zero overtopping from values below detection limits. Quantify collector zero drift through a blank test.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。以另一種流量或重量量測交叉檢查，保留零越波與低於檢出限的區別。","textEn":"Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage. Cross-check by weight or independent flow measurement and distinguish zero overtopping from values below detection limits.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「集水控制體積」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Collection control volume\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。","用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels.","Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b281-v15-12","title":"集水控制體積：失效診斷","titleEn":"Collection control volume: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「集水控制體積」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Collection control volume” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"狹窄收集槽可能漏掉斜向越波，餘水又可能被算到下一組試驗；這兩種偏差可互相抵銷，使平均值看似穩定，卻無法支持不同斷面的可靠比較。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A narrow collector can miss oblique discharge while retained water enters the next test. Opposing biases may cancel in the mean, producing apparently stable results that do not support reliable comparison between sections. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：計量解析度在低越波情境尤其重要，小讀值可能與容器零點漂移相當。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Meter resolution becomes especially important at low overtopping, where the collected increment may resemble tank zero drift.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"狹窄收集槽可能漏掉斜向越波，餘水又可能被算到下一組試驗；這兩種偏差可互相抵銷，使平均值看似穩定，卻無法支持不同斷面的可靠比較。","textEn":"A narrow collector can miss oblique discharge while retained water enters the next test. Opposing biases may cancel in the mean, producing apparently stable results that do not support reliable comparison between sections.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「集水控制體積」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Collection control volume\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["狹窄收集槽可能漏掉斜向越波，餘水又可能被算到下一組試驗；這兩種偏差可互相抵銷，使平均值看似穩定，卻無法支持不同斷面的可靠比較。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。"],"optionsEn":["A narrow collector can miss oblique discharge while retained water enters the next test.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height."],"answer":0,"explanation":"狹窄收集槽可能漏掉斜向越波，餘水又可能被算到下一組試驗；這兩種偏差可互相抵銷，使平均值看似穩定，卻無法支持不同斷面的可靠比較。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A narrow collector can miss oblique discharge while retained water enters the next test. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b281-v15-13","title":"不規則波能量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Irregular-wave energy: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「不規則波能量」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Irregular-wave energy” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"不規則波需由波面紀錄建立能譜及統計量，單一最大波不能取代整段波列的代表波高。頻帶截取、漂移去除和量測位置會改變零階譜矩，需記清處理方法，才能把造波設定與入射波條件對上。 假設零階譜矩m0=0.0025m²，Hm0=4√m0=0.20m；m0增10%時波高乘√1.1而非1.1。 譜矩是波面變異的積分描述，頻率單位與積分間距必須在程式中一致。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「不規則波能量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Irregular waves require a surface-elevation record, spectrum and statistical description. One maximum wave cannot replace a representative height for the sequence. Frequency limits, detrending and measurement location alter the zero-order spectral moment, so processing must remain traceable when comparing generator settings with incident conditions. Assume zero-order moment m0=0.0025m². Hm0=4√m0=0.20m; increasing m0 by10% multiplies height by√1.1, not1.1. The moment integrates surface-elevation variance, requiring consistent frequency units and integration spacing throughout the processing code. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Irregular-wave energy” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「不規則波能量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Irregular-wave energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-13-k1","title":"不規則波能量","titleEn":"Irregular-wave energy","text":"不規則波需由波面紀錄建立能譜及統計量，單一最大波不能取代整段波列的代表波高。頻帶截取、漂移去除和量測位置會改變零階譜矩，需記清處理方法，才能把造波設定與入射波條件對上。","textEn":"Irregular waves require a surface-elevation record, spectrum and statistical description. One maximum wave cannot replace a representative height for the sequence.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「不規則波能量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Irregular-wave energy\" is correct?","options":["最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。","不規則波需由波面紀錄建立能譜及統計量，單一最大波不能取代整段波列的代表波高。","相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。"],"optionsEn":["Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height.","Irregular waves require a surface-elevation record, spectrum and statistical description.","Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping."],"answer":1,"explanation":"不規則波需由波面紀錄建立能譜及統計量，單一最大波不能取代整段波列的代表波高。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Irregular waves require a surface-elevation record, spectrum and statistical description. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b281-v15-14","title":"不規則波能量：定量估算","titleEn":"Irregular-wave energy: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「不規則波能量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Irregular-wave energy” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設零階譜矩m0=0.0025m²，Hm0=4√m0=0.20m；m0增10%時波高乘√1.1而非1.1。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume zero-order moment m0=0.0025m². Hm0=4√m0=0.20m; increasing m0 by10% multiplies height by√1.1, not1.1. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設零階譜矩m0=0.0025m²，Hm0=4√m0=0.20m；m0增10%時波高乘√1.1而非1.1。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume zero-order moment m0=0.0025m². Hm0=4√m0=0.20m; increasing m0 by10% multiplies height by√1.1, not1.1.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「不規則波能量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Irregular-wave energy\", which statement holds?","options":["每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。","重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak.","Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b281-v15-15","title":"不規則波能量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Irregular-wave energy: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「不規則波能量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Irregular-wave energy” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。用時域波高分布交叉比較譜波高，並列出兩者定義差異而非強迫相等。獨立檢查頻率積分與波面變異數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently. Compare spectral height with the time-domain wave-height distribution, documenting their differing definitions instead of forcing numerical agreement. Independently compare spectral integration with surface-elevation variance. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。用時域波高分布交叉比較譜波高，並列出兩者定義差異而非強迫相等。","observationEn":"Site practice: Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently. Compare spectral height with the time-domain wave-height distribution, documenting their differing definitions instead of forcing numerical agreement.","failure":"注意干擾：感測器慢漂移若被當成低頻波能，譜矩會被抬高；另一方面過度濾波可能刪掉真實長週期能量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Slow sensor drift mistaken for wave energy inflates the spectral moment, while aggressive filtering removes genuine long-period energy. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。用時域波高分布交叉比較譜波高，並列出兩者定義差異而非強迫相等。獨立檢查頻率積分與波面變異數。","textEn":"Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently. Compare spectral height with the time-domain wave-height distribution, documenting their differing definitions instead of forcing numerical agreement. Independently compare spectral integration with surface-elevation variance.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。用時域波高分布交叉比較譜波高，並列出兩者定義差異而非強迫相等。","textEn":"Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently. Compare spectral height with the time-domain wave-height distribution, documenting their differing definitions instead of forcing numerical agreement.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「不規則波能量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Irregular-wave energy\"?","options":["保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。"],"optionsEn":["Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar."],"answer":0,"explanation":"保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b281-v15-16","title":"不規則波能量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Irregular-wave energy: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「不規則波能量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Irregular-wave energy” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"感測器慢漂移若被當成低頻波能，譜矩會被抬高；另一方面過度濾波可能刪掉真實長週期能量。相同造波設定不能保證處理後的有效波況相同。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Slow sensor drift mistaken for wave energy inflates the spectral moment, while aggressive filtering removes genuine long-period energy. Identical generator settings therefore do not guarantee equivalent effective wave conditions after processing. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：譜矩是波面變異的積分描述，頻率單位與積分間距必須在程式中一致。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The moment integrates surface-elevation variance, requiring consistent frequency units and integration spacing throughout the processing code.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"感測器慢漂移若被當成低頻波能，譜矩會被抬高；另一方面過度濾波可能刪掉真實長週期能量。相同造波設定不能保證處理後的有效波況相同。","textEn":"Slow sensor drift mistaken for wave energy inflates the spectral moment, while aggressive filtering removes genuine long-period energy. Identical generator settings therefore do not guarantee equivalent effective wave conditions after processing.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「不規則波能量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Irregular-wave energy\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","感測器慢漂移若被當成低頻波能，譜矩會被抬高；另一方面過度濾波可能刪掉真實長週期能量。","相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Slow sensor drift mistaken for wave energy inflates the spectral moment, while aggressive filtering removes genuine long-period energy.","Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping."],"answer":1,"explanation":"感測器慢漂移若被當成低頻波能，譜矩會被抬高；另一方面過度濾波可能刪掉真實長週期能量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Slow sensor drift mistaken for wave energy inflates the spectral moment, while aggressive filtering removes genuine long-period energy. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b281-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「相對出水高度」與「入射反射分離」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Relative crest freeboard\" and \"Incident-reflected wave separation\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b281-v15-17","title":"相對出水高度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Relative crest freeboard: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「相對出水高度」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Relative crest freeboard” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"越波對堤頂相對水面的高度十分敏感，潮位、增水及基準偏差都會改變有效出水高。比較試驗時必須區分堤頂變化和靜水面變化，兩者在幾何上可能等效，但對前灘水深與破波位置的影響不同。 假設Rc=0.10m、Hm0=0.20m，比值Rc/Hm0=0.50；水位上升0.02m且堤頂不變時比值為0.40。 有效出水高的分母應使用結構前指定位置的入射波，而非任意遠端設定值。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「相對出水高度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Overtopping responds strongly to crest level relative to still water. Tide, surge and datum bias alter effective freeboard. Crest adjustment and water-level change can produce the same nominal freeboard while changing foreshore depth and breaking location differently, so the complete geometry must be retained. Assume Rc=0.10m and Hm0=0.20m, giving Rc/Hm0=0.50. Raising water0.02m at fixed crest changes the ratio to0.40. Relative freeboard should use incident waves at the specified structure location rather than an arbitrary distant generator setting. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Relative crest freeboard” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「相對出水高度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Relative crest freeboard”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-17-k1","title":"相對出水高度","titleEn":"Relative crest freeboard","text":"越波對堤頂相對水面的高度十分敏感，潮位、增水及基準偏差都會改變有效出水高。比較試驗時必須區分堤頂變化和靜水面變化，兩者在幾何上可能等效，但對前灘水深與破波位置的影響不同。","textEn":"Overtopping responds strongly to crest level relative to still water. Tide, surge and datum bias alter effective freeboard.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「相對出水高度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Relative crest freeboard\" is correct?","options":["相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。","反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。","越波對堤頂相對水面的高度十分敏感，潮位、增水及基準偏差都會改變有效出水高。"],"optionsEn":["Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping.","Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.","Overtopping responds strongly to crest level relative to still water."],"answer":2,"explanation":"越波對堤頂相對水面的高度十分敏感，潮位、增水及基準偏差都會改變有效出水高。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Overtopping responds strongly to crest level relative to still water. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b281-v15-18","title":"相對出水高度：定量估算","titleEn":"Relative crest freeboard: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「相對出水高度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Relative crest freeboard” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設Rc=0.10m、Hm0=0.20m，比值Rc/Hm0=0.50；水位上升0.02m且堤頂不變時比值為0.40。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume Rc=0.10m and Hm0=0.20m, giving Rc/Hm0=0.50. Raising water0.02m at fixed crest changes the ratio to0.40. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設Rc=0.10m、Hm0=0.20m，比值Rc/Hm0=0.50；水位上升0.02m且堤頂不變時比值為0.40。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume Rc=0.10m and Hm0=0.20m, giving Rc/Hm0=0.50. Raising water0.02m at fixed crest changes the ratio to0.40.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「相對出水高度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Relative crest freeboard\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。","平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access.","Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b281-v15-19","title":"相對出水高度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Relative crest freeboard: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「相對出水高度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Relative crest freeboard” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。重做水位改變時需重新校準結構前的入射波，檢查是否同時改變破波型態。列出水位修正前後的前灘水深。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix. Recalibrate incident waves before the structure after changing water level, checking for a simultaneous change in breaking regime. List foreshore depths before and after each level correction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。重做水位改變時需重新校準結構前的入射波，檢查是否同時改變破波型態。","observationEn":"Site practice: Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix. Recalibrate incident waves before the structure after changing water level, checking for a simultaneous change in breaking regime.","failure":"注意干擾：模型底板沉陷或水位零點偏移會讓標稱出水高失真，越波量變化可能因此被誤認為新堤型較好；只校核堤頂尺寸而忽略水面基準無法辨識原因。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Settlement of the model base or water-level zero drift corrupts nominal freeboard. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。重做水位改變時需重新校準結構前的入射波，檢查是否同時改變破波型態。列出水位修正前後的前灘水深。","textEn":"Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix. Recalibrate incident waves before the structure after changing water level, checking for a simultaneous change in breaking regime. List foreshore depths before and after each level correction.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。重做水位改變時需重新校準結構前的入射波，檢查是否同時改變破波型態。","textEn":"Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix. Recalibrate incident waves before the structure after changing water level, checking for a simultaneous change in breaking regime.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「相對出水高度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Relative crest freeboard\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。","單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix.","Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent."],"answer":1,"explanation":"從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b281-v15-20","title":"相對出水高度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Relative crest freeboard: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「相對出水高度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Relative crest freeboard” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"模型底板沉陷或水位零點偏移會讓標稱出水高失真，越波量變化可能因此被誤認為新堤型較好；只校核堤頂尺寸而忽略水面基準無法辨識原因。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Settlement of the model base or water-level zero drift corrupts nominal freeboard. The resulting discharge change may be mistaken for an improved wall geometry, and checking crest dimensions alone will not reveal the cause. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：有效出水高的分母應使用結構前指定位置的入射波，而非任意遠端設定值。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Relative freeboard should use incident waves at the specified structure location rather than an arbitrary distant generator setting.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"模型底板沉陷或水位零點偏移會讓標稱出水高失真，越波量變化可能因此被誤認為新堤型較好；只校核堤頂尺寸而忽略水面基準無法辨識原因。","textEn":"Settlement of the model base or water-level zero drift corrupts nominal freeboard. The resulting discharge change may be mistaken for an improved wall geometry, and checking crest dimensions alone will not reveal the cause.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「相對出水高度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Relative crest freeboard\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。","模型底板沉陷或水位零點偏移會讓標稱出水高失真，越波量變化可能因此被誤認為新堤型較好；只校核堤頂尺寸而忽略水面基準無法辨識原因。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.","Settlement of the model base or water-level zero drift corrupts nominal freeboard."],"answer":2,"explanation":"模型底板沉陷或水位零點偏移會讓標稱出水高失真，越波量變化可能因此被誤認為新堤型較好；只校核堤頂尺寸而忽略水面基準無法辨識原因。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Settlement of the model base or water-level zero drift corrupts nominal freeboard. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b281-v15-21","title":"入射反射分離：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Incident-reflected wave separation: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「入射反射分離」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Incident-reflected wave separation” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"結構反射與入射波疊加形成空間起伏，單點量測可能剛好位在節點或腹點。要把試驗與設計入射波連結，需用適當測點配置和分離方法；反射振幅比也不能直接當成反射能量比。 假設分離得到入射振幅0.50m、反射0.20m，Kr=0.40；同介質同頻率下反射能量比約Kr²=0.16。 能量比例的平方關係還假設入射和反射有相同的傳播介質與群速。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「入射反射分離」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Reflected and incident waves create spatial interference, so a single gauge may sit near a node or antinode. Appropriate gauge geometry and separation are needed to recover incident conditions. An amplitude reflection coefficient also differs from the associated energy fraction under matched propagation conditions. Assume separated incident and reflected amplitudes0.50m and0.20m. Kr=0.40; for matched medium and frequency the reflected energy fraction is approximately0.16. Squaring amplitudes for energy additionally assumes matched propagation medium and group velocity for incident and reflected components. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Incident-reflected wave separation” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「入射反射分離」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Incident-reflected wave separation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-21-k1","title":"入射反射分離","titleEn":"Incident-reflected wave separation","text":"結構反射與入射波疊加形成空間起伏，單點量測可能剛好位在節點或腹點。要把試驗與設計入射波連結，需用適當測點配置和分離方法；反射振幅比也不能直接當成反射能量比。","textEn":"Reflected and incident waves create spatial interference, so a single gauge may sit near a node or antinode. Appropriate gauge geometry and separation are needed to recover incident conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「入射反射分離」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Incident-reflected wave separation\" is correct?","options":["結構反射與入射波疊加形成空間起伏，單點量測可能剛好位在節點或腹點。","反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。","每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。"],"optionsEn":["Reflected and incident waves create spatial interference, so a single gauge may sit near a node or antinode.","Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.","Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak."],"answer":0,"explanation":"結構反射與入射波疊加形成空間起伏，單點量測可能剛好位在節點或腹點。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Reflected and incident waves create spatial interference, so a single gauge may sit near a node or antinode. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b281-v15-22","title":"入射反射分離：定量估算","titleEn":"Incident-reflected wave separation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「入射反射分離」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Incident-reflected wave separation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設分離得到入射振幅0.50m、反射0.20m，Kr=0.40；同介質同頻率下反射能量比約Kr²=0.16。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume separated incident and reflected amplitudes0.50m and0.20m. Kr=0.40; for matched medium and frequency the reflected energy fraction is approximately0.16. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設分離得到入射振幅0.50m、反射0.20m，Kr=0.40；同介質同頻率下反射能量比約Kr²=0.16。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume separated incident and reflected amplitudes0.50m and0.20m. Kr=0.40; for matched medium and frequency the reflected energy fraction is approximately0.16.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「入射反射分離」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Incident-reflected wave separation\", which statement holds?","options":["重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。"],"optionsEn":["Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b281-v15-23","title":"入射反射分離：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Incident-reflected wave separation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「入射反射分離」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Incident-reflected wave separation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。用多組距離重算結果並記錄無法可靠分離的頻帶，避免只報一個漂亮係數。對分離後波列重建原始量測訊號。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength. Recompute using alternative gauge combinations and identify frequency bands with unreliable separation rather than reporting only one attractive overall coefficient. Reconstruct measured signals from the separated wave components. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。用多組距離重算結果並記錄無法可靠分離的頻帶，避免只報一個漂亮係數。","observationEn":"Site practice: Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength. Recompute using alternative gauge combinations and identify frequency bands with unreliable separation rather than reporting only one attractive overall coefficient.","failure":"注意干擾：測點間距落在病態幾何時，微小讀值誤差會被放大成不合理反射；若再用錯誤入射波高歸一化越波量，兩個分析步驟會共同偏離真實條件。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ill-conditioned gauge spacing magnifies small reading errors into unrealistic reflection. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。用多組距離重算結果並記錄無法可靠分離的頻帶，避免只報一個漂亮係數。對分離後波列重建原始量測訊號。","textEn":"Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength. Recompute using alternative gauge combinations and identify frequency bands with unreliable separation rather than reporting only one attractive overall coefficient. Reconstruct measured signals from the separated wave components.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。用多組距離重算結果並記錄無法可靠分離的頻帶，避免只報一個漂亮係數。","textEn":"Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength. Recompute using alternative gauge combinations and identify frequency bands with unreliable separation rather than reporting only one attractive overall coefficient.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「入射反射分離」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Incident-reflected wave separation\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。","先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.","Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength."],"answer":2,"explanation":"先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b281-v15-24","title":"入射反射分離：失效診斷","titleEn":"Incident-reflected wave separation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「入射反射分離」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Incident-reflected wave separation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"測點間距落在病態幾何時，微小讀值誤差會被放大成不合理反射；若再用錯誤入射波高歸一化越波量，兩個分析步驟會共同偏離真實條件。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ill-conditioned gauge spacing magnifies small reading errors into unrealistic reflection. Normalizing discharge with the resulting wrong incident height compounds the error across two analysis stages, even when both outputs appear smoothly varying. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：能量比例的平方關係還假設入射和反射有相同的傳播介質與群速。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Squaring amplitudes for energy additionally assumes matched propagation medium and group velocity for incident and reflected components.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"測點間距落在病態幾何時，微小讀值誤差會被放大成不合理反射；若再用錯誤入射波高歸一化越波量，兩個分析步驟會共同偏離真實條件。","textEn":"Ill-conditioned gauge spacing magnifies small reading errors into unrealistic reflection. Normalizing discharge with the resulting wrong incident height compounds the error across two analysis stages, even when both outputs appear smoothly varying.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「入射反射分離」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Incident-reflected wave separation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["測點間距落在病態幾何時，微小讀值誤差會被放大成不合理反射；若再用錯誤入射波高歸一化越波量，兩個分析步驟會共同偏離真實條件。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。"],"optionsEn":["Ill-conditioned gauge spacing magnifies small reading errors into unrealistic reflection.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak."],"answer":0,"explanation":"測點間距落在病態幾何時，微小讀值誤差會被放大成不合理反射；若再用錯誤入射波高歸一化越波量，兩個分析步驟會共同偏離真實條件。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ill-conditioned gauge spacing magnifies small reading errors into unrealistic reflection. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b281-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「取樣頻帶配置」與「堤頂水舌流態」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sampling bandwidth selection\" and \"Crest-flow regime\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b281-v15-25","title":"取樣頻帶配置：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Sampling bandwidth selection: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「取樣頻帶配置」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sampling bandwidth selection” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"波面和衝擊壓力的時間尺度不同，能記錄主波週期的頻率不一定能捕捉短暫壓峰。取樣前的類比濾波與感測器自身頻率響應同樣重要，事後加密插值只能增加點數，無法回復已混疊或漏掉的訊號。 假設取樣20Hz，理想奈奎斯特頻率10Hz；週期2s波有40點，但不能據此保證毫秒衝擊峰值準確。 感測器的固有頻率和裝置共振同樣限制有效頻帶，不能僅查擷取器規格。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「取樣頻帶配置」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Surface elevation and impact pressure occupy different timescales. Sampling sufficient for the main wave period may miss brief pressure peaks. Analog filtering and sensor response matter before digitization; interpolating afterward increases sample count without recovering aliased or absent information. Assume sampling20Hz: ideal Nyquist frequency is10Hz and a2s wave has40 points. This does not establish accuracy for millisecond impact peaks. Sensor natural frequency and rig resonance also limit useful bandwidth, so acquisition specifications alone are insufficient evidence. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sampling bandwidth selection” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「取樣頻帶配置」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sampling bandwidth selection”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-25-k1","title":"取樣頻帶配置","titleEn":"Sampling bandwidth selection","text":"波面和衝擊壓力的時間尺度不同，能記錄主波週期的頻率不一定能捕捉短暫壓峰。取樣前的類比濾波與感測器自身頻率響應同樣重要，事後加密插值只能增加點數，無法回復已混疊或漏掉的訊號。","textEn":"Surface elevation and impact pressure occupy different timescales. Sampling sufficient for the main wave period may miss brief pressure peaks.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「取樣頻帶配置」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sampling bandwidth selection\" is correct?","options":["每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。","波面和衝擊壓力的時間尺度不同，能記錄主波週期的頻率不一定能捕捉短暫壓峰。","弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。"],"optionsEn":["Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak.","Surface elevation and impact pressure occupy different timescales.","A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access."],"answer":1,"explanation":"波面和衝擊壓力的時間尺度不同，能記錄主波週期的頻率不一定能捕捉短暫壓峰。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Surface elevation and impact pressure occupy different timescales. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b281-v15-26","title":"取樣頻帶配置：定量估算","titleEn":"Sampling bandwidth selection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「取樣頻帶配置」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sampling bandwidth selection” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設取樣20Hz，理想奈奎斯特頻率10Hz；週期2s波有40點，但不能據此保證毫秒衝擊峰值準確。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume sampling20Hz: ideal Nyquist frequency is10Hz and a2s wave has40 points. This does not establish accuracy for millisecond impact peaks. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設取樣20Hz，理想奈奎斯特頻率10Hz；週期2s波有40點，但不能據此保證毫秒衝擊峰值準確。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume sampling20Hz: ideal Nyquist frequency is10Hz and a2s wave has40 points. This does not establish accuracy for millisecond impact peaks.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「取樣頻帶配置」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sampling bandwidth selection\", which statement holds?","options":["平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。","單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels.","Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b281-v15-27","title":"取樣頻帶配置：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Sampling bandwidth selection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「取樣頻帶配置」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sampling bandwidth selection” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。以已知快變訊號檢查峰值與相位，保留抗混疊設定及原始時間戳供重算。比較不同取樣率所得峰值收斂性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain. Use a known rapidly changing signal to assess peak and phase response, retaining anti-alias settings and raw timestamps for reconstruction. Compare peak convergence at several justified sampling rates. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。以已知快變訊號檢查峰值與相位，保留抗混疊設定及原始時間戳供重算。","observationEn":"Site practice: Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain. Use a known rapidly changing signal to assess peak and phase response, retaining anti-alias settings and raw timestamps for reconstruction.","failure":"注意干擾：過低頻率會漏掉短峰，過高頻率若未控制電噪音又可能產生假峰。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Low sampling misses short peaks, while uncontrolled electrical noise at high rates creates false ones. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。以已知快變訊號檢查峰值與相位，保留抗混疊設定及原始時間戳供重算。比較不同取樣率所得峰值收斂性。","textEn":"Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain. Use a known rapidly changing signal to assess peak and phase response, retaining anti-alias settings and raw timestamps for reconstruction. Compare peak convergence at several justified sampling rates.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。以已知快變訊號檢查峰值與相位，保留抗混疊設定及原始時間戳供重算。","textEn":"Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain. Use a known rapidly changing signal to assess peak and phase response, retaining anti-alias settings and raw timestamps for reconstruction.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「取樣頻帶配置」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sampling bandwidth selection\"?","options":["分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。"],"optionsEn":["Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height."],"answer":0,"explanation":"分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b281-v15-28","title":"取樣頻帶配置：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sampling bandwidth selection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「取樣頻帶配置」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sampling bandwidth selection” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"過低頻率會漏掉短峰，過高頻率若未控制電噪音又可能產生假峰。平滑後的波形不等於可信波形，將其當結構設計荷載前仍須確認頻率響應。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Low sampling misses short peaks, while uncontrolled electrical noise at high rates creates false ones. A smooth trace is not automatically credible, and structural load interpretation still requires demonstrated frequency response of the measurement chain. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：感測器的固有頻率和裝置共振同樣限制有效頻帶，不能僅查擷取器規格。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Sensor natural frequency and rig resonance also limit useful bandwidth, so acquisition specifications alone are insufficient evidence.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"過低頻率會漏掉短峰，過高頻率若未控制電噪音又可能產生假峰。平滑後的波形不等於可信波形，將其當結構設計荷載前仍須確認頻率響應。","textEn":"Low sampling misses short peaks, while uncontrolled electrical noise at high rates creates false ones. A smooth trace is not automatically credible, and structural load interpretation still requires demonstrated frequency response of the measurement chain.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「取樣頻帶配置」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sampling bandwidth selection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","過低頻率會漏掉短峰，過高頻率若未控制電噪音又可能產生假峰。","弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Low sampling misses short peaks, while uncontrolled electrical noise at high rates creates false ones.","A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access."],"answer":1,"explanation":"過低頻率會漏掉短峰，過高頻率若未控制電噪音又可能產生假峰。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Low sampling misses short peaks, while uncontrolled electrical noise at high rates creates false ones. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b281-v15-29","title":"堤頂水舌流態：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Crest-flow regime: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「堤頂水舌流態」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Crest-flow regime” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"跨堤水舌具有局部水深與速度，平均單寬流量無法唯一決定兩者。弗勞德數可比較慣性與重力尺度，但不含人員失衡、漂浮物及脈動衝擊；同一平均越波量仍可能對應很不同的瞬間流況。 假設局部v=2m/s、h=0.30m，Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17；這是局部流態指標，不是通行安全判定。 水舌前緣可能近似乾濕交界，局部水深接近零時此比值會很敏感。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「堤頂水舌流態」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A crest water tongue has local depth and velocity that mean unit discharge cannot uniquely determine. The Froude number compares inertia with gravity but excludes pedestrian instability, debris and impulsive loading. Equal mean overtopping can therefore conceal very different instantaneous flow regimes at the crest. Assume local v=2m/s and h=0.30m. Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17 is a local flow-regime indicator, not an access-safety decision. The tongue front approaches a wet-dry boundary, making the ratio highly sensitive when local depth approaches zero. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Crest-flow regime” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「堤頂水舌流態」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Crest-flow regime”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-29-k1","title":"堤頂水舌流態","titleEn":"Crest-flow regime","text":"跨堤水舌具有局部水深與速度，平均單寬流量無法唯一決定兩者。弗勞德數可比較慣性與重力尺度，但不含人員失衡、漂浮物及脈動衝擊；同一平均越波量仍可能對應很不同的瞬間流況。","textEn":"A crest water tongue has local depth and velocity that mean unit discharge cannot uniquely determine. The Froude number compares inertia with gravity but excludes pedestrian instability, debris and impulsive loading.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「堤頂水舌流態」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Crest-flow regime\" is correct?","options":["弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。","重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。","跨堤水舌具有局部水深與速度，平均單寬流量無法唯一決定兩者。"],"optionsEn":["A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access.","Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.","A crest water tongue has local depth and velocity that mean unit discharge cannot uniquely determine."],"answer":2,"explanation":"跨堤水舌具有局部水深與速度，平均單寬流量無法唯一決定兩者。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A crest water tongue has local depth and velocity that mean unit discharge cannot uniquely determine. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b281-v15-30","title":"堤頂水舌流態：定量估算","titleEn":"Crest-flow regime: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「堤頂水舌流態」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Crest-flow regime” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設局部v=2m/s、h=0.30m，Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17；這是局部流態指標，不是通行安全判定。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume local v=2m/s and h=0.30m. Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17 is a local flow-regime indicator, not an access-safety decision. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設局部v=2m/s、h=0.30m，Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17；這是局部流態指標，不是通行安全判定。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume local v=2m/s and h=0.30m. Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17 is a local flow-regime indicator, not an access-safety decision.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「堤頂水舌流態」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Crest-flow regime\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。","收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar.","A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b281-v15-31","title":"堤頂水舌流態：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Crest-flow regime: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「堤頂水舌流態」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Crest-flow regime” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。用影像核對水舌範圍及持續時間，並把局部資料和整段平均流量分開呈現。記錄深度感測器失效與含氣片段。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow. Use video to confirm tongue extent and duration, presenting local measurements separately from whole-sequence mean discharge. Flag depth-sensor dropout and strongly aerated intervals explicitly. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。用影像核對水舌範圍及持續時間，並把局部資料和整段平均流量分開呈現。","observationEn":"Site practice: Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow. Use video to confirm tongue extent and duration, presenting local measurements separately from whole-sequence mean discharge.","failure":"注意干擾：水深與速度不同步會產生根本未發生的極端組合，含氣又可能讓讀值失真。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Unsynchronized depth and velocity create extreme combinations that never occurred, while air distorts measurements. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。用影像核對水舌範圍及持續時間，並把局部資料和整段平均流量分開呈現。記錄深度感測器失效與含氣片段。","textEn":"Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow. Use video to confirm tongue extent and duration, presenting local measurements separately from whole-sequence mean discharge. Flag depth-sensor dropout and strongly aerated intervals explicitly.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。用影像核對水舌範圍及持續時間，並把局部資料和整段平均流量分開呈現。","textEn":"Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow. Use video to confirm tongue extent and duration, presenting local measurements separately from whole-sequence mean discharge.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「堤頂水舌流態」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Crest-flow regime\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。","相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow.","Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping."],"answer":1,"explanation":"同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b281-v15-32","title":"堤頂水舌流態：失效診斷","titleEn":"Crest-flow regime: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「堤頂水舌流態」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Crest-flow regime” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"水深與速度不同步會產生根本未發生的極端組合，含氣又可能讓讀值失真。只報單一弗勞德數會掩蓋持續時間與空間分布，無法支撐通行或構造安全宣稱。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Unsynchronized depth and velocity create extreme combinations that never occurred, while air distorts measurements. One Froude value hides duration and spatial distribution and cannot establish public access or structural safety by itself. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：水舌前緣可能近似乾濕交界，局部水深接近零時此比值會很敏感。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The tongue front approaches a wet-dry boundary, making the ratio highly sensitive when local depth approaches zero.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"水深與速度不同步會產生根本未發生的極端組合，含氣又可能讓讀值失真。只報單一弗勞德數會掩蓋持續時間與空間分布，無法支撐通行或構造安全宣稱。","textEn":"Unsynchronized depth and velocity create extreme combinations that never occurred, while air distorts measurements. One Froude value hides duration and spatial distribution and cannot establish public access or structural safety by itself.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「堤頂水舌流態」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Crest-flow regime\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。","水深與速度不同步會產生根本未發生的極端組合，含氣又可能讓讀值失真。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.","Unsynchronized depth and velocity create extreme combinations that never occurred, while air distorts measurements."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水深與速度不同步會產生根本未發生的極端組合，含氣又可能讓讀值失真。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Unsynchronized depth and velocity create extreme combinations that never occurred, while air distorts measurements. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b281-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「重複試驗變異」與「局部荷載與平均量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Repeated-test variability\" and \"Local load versus mean flow\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b281-v15-33","title":"重複試驗變異：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Repeated-test variability: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「重複試驗變異」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Repeated-test variability” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"相同能譜可以由不同隨機相位波列實現，少數大波會影響集水平均與最大事件。重複試驗應涵蓋波列變異，而不只是重讀同一段資料；平均值的不確定度也不等於單次事件分散程度。 假設三次q為0.4、0.5、0.6L/s/m，平均0.5、樣本標準差0.1，獨立時平均標準誤0.1/√3=0.0577；樣本僅3。 獨立性涉及實際波列而非檔案數量，系統校準偏差也不會隨重複次數消失。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「重複試驗變異」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The same spectrum can be realized through different random-phase sequences, and a few large waves influence collected means and maxima. Repeats should sample sequence variability rather than reread identical data. Uncertainty of the mean differs from the spread of individual events or test outcomes. Assume q=0.4,0.5,0.6L/s/m: mean0.5, sample deviation0.1 and independent-mean standard error0.0577. Only3 realizations are represented. Independence concerns the physical realization rather than file count, and shared calibration bias does not vanish through repetition. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Repeated-test variability” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「重複試驗變異」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Repeated-test variability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-33-k1","title":"重複試驗變異","titleEn":"Repeated-test variability","text":"相同能譜可以由不同隨機相位波列實現，少數大波會影響集水平均與最大事件。重複試驗應涵蓋波列變異，而不只是重讀同一段資料；平均值的不確定度也不等於單次事件分散程度。","textEn":"The same spectrum can be realized through different random-phase sequences, and a few large waves influence collected means and maxima. Repeats should sample sequence variability rather than reread identical data.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「重複試驗變異」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Repeated-test variability\" is correct?","options":["相同能譜可以由不同隨機相位波列實現，少數大波會影響集水平均與最大事件。","重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。","平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。"],"optionsEn":["The same spectrum can be realized through different random-phase sequences, and a few large waves influence collected means and maxima.","Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.","Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相同能譜可以由不同隨機相位波列實現，少數大波會影響集水平均與最大事件。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The same spectrum can be realized through different random-phase sequences, and a few large waves influence collected means and maxima. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b281-v15-34","title":"重複試驗變異：定量估算","titleEn":"Repeated-test variability: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「重複試驗變異」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Repeated-test variability” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設三次q為0.4、0.5、0.6L/s/m，平均0.5、樣本標準差0.1，獨立時平均標準誤0.1/√3=0.0577；樣本僅3。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume q=0.4,0.5,0.6L/s/m: mean0.5, sample deviation0.1 and independent-mean standard error0.0577. Only3 realizations are represented. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設三次q為0.4、0.5、0.6L/s/m，平均0.5、樣本標準差0.1，獨立時平均標準誤0.1/√3=0.0577；樣本僅3。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume q=0.4,0.5,0.6L/s/m: mean0.5, sample deviation0.1 and independent-mean standard error0.0577. Only3 realizations are represented.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「重複試驗變異」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Repeated-test variability\", which statement holds?","options":["單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。"],"optionsEn":["Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b281-v15-35","title":"重複試驗變異：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Repeated-test variability: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「重複試驗變異」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Repeated-test variability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。檢查樣本是否真正獨立，並在報告列出原始三次結果，避免只留下不確定度最小的組合。分開列出隨機變異與共同校準誤差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately. Check genuine independence and report the original realizations instead of retaining only the combination with the smallest apparent uncertainty. Separate random variability from shared calibration uncertainty explicitly. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。檢查樣本是否真正獨立，並在報告列出原始三次結果，避免只留下不確定度最小的組合。","observationEn":"Site practice: Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately. Check genuine independence and report the original realizations instead of retaining only the combination with the smallest apparent uncertainty.","failure":"注意干擾：重用同一波列再把它當獨立樣本會虛增有效樣本數，標準誤因此過小；刪除一次較大越波結果更會直接扭曲工程所關心的尾部行為與風險。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Reusing one wave sequence as independent observations inflates sample size and understates standard error. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。檢查樣本是否真正獨立，並在報告列出原始三次結果，避免只留下不確定度最小的組合。分開列出隨機變異與共同校準誤差。","textEn":"Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately. Check genuine independence and report the original realizations instead of retaining only the combination with the smallest apparent uncertainty. Separate random variability from shared calibration uncertainty explicitly.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。檢查樣本是否真正獨立，並在報告列出原始三次結果，避免只留下不確定度最小的組合。","textEn":"Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately. Check genuine independence and report the original realizations instead of retaining only the combination with the smallest apparent uncertainty.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「重複試驗變異」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Repeated-test variability\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。","記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.","Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately."],"answer":2,"explanation":"記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b281-v15-36","title":"重複試驗變異：失效診斷","titleEn":"Repeated-test variability: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「重複試驗變異」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Repeated-test variability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"重用同一波列再把它當獨立樣本會虛增有效樣本數，標準誤因此過小；刪除一次較大越波結果更會直接扭曲工程所關心的尾部行為與風險。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Reusing one wave sequence as independent observations inflates sample size and understates standard error. Removing a high-discharge realization further distorts the tail behavior that matters for the engineering interpretation of unusually severe events. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：獨立性涉及實際波列而非檔案數量，系統校準偏差也不會隨重複次數消失。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Independence concerns the physical realization rather than file count, and shared calibration bias does not vanish through repetition.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"重用同一波列再把它當獨立樣本會虛增有效樣本數，標準誤因此過小；刪除一次較大越波結果更會直接扭曲工程所關心的尾部行為與風險。","textEn":"Reusing one wave sequence as independent observations inflates sample size and understates standard error. Removing a high-discharge realization further distorts the tail behavior that matters for the engineering interpretation of unusually severe events.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「重複試驗變異」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Repeated-test variability\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["重用同一波列再把它當獨立樣本會虛增有效樣本數，標準誤因此過小；刪除一次較大越波結果更會直接扭曲工程所關心的尾部行為與風險。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing one wave sequence as independent observations inflates sample size and understates standard error.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels."],"answer":0,"explanation":"重用同一波列再把它當獨立樣本會虛增有效樣本數，標準誤因此過小；刪除一次較大越波結果更會直接扭曲工程所關心的尾部行為與風險。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reusing one wave sequence as independent observations inflates sample size and understates standard error. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b281-v15-37","title":"局部荷載與平均量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Local load versus mean flow: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「局部荷載與平均量」如何影響海堤越波模型試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Local load versus mean flow” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Overtopping model tests for seawalls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"越波平均量適合描述一段時間的水量，但堤後構件可能由短時局部衝擊控制。力、壓力和受力面積必須區分，壓力感測器的空間平均也會抹去小範圍峰值；不能由流量合格推論所有附屬構件合格。 假設均勻瞬時合力100N作用於0.020m²平板，p=F/A=5kPa；不代表其他面積或非均勻衝擊峰值。 峰值持續時間決定荷載衝量，結構反應也受自身頻率與阻尼控制。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「局部荷載與平均量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Mean overtopping describes water quantity over time, whereas a rear-side element may be governed by a brief localized impact. Distinguish force, pressure and loaded area; spatial averaging by a pressure sensor also smooths small peaks. Passing a discharge criterion does not qualify every secondary component. Assume a uniform instantaneous100N resultant on a0.020m² plate. p=F/A=5kPa does not represent another area or a nonuniform impact peak. Peak duration controls load impulse, while the structural response additionally depends on its natural frequencies and damping. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Local load versus mean flow” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「局部荷載與平均量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Local load versus mean flow”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-37-k1","title":"局部荷載與平均量","titleEn":"Local load versus mean flow","text":"越波平均量適合描述一段時間的水量，但堤後構件可能由短時局部衝擊控制。力、壓力和受力面積必須區分，壓力感測器的空間平均也會抹去小範圍峰值；不能由流量合格推論所有附屬構件合格。","textEn":"Mean overtopping describes water quantity over time, whereas a rear-side element may be governed by a brief localized impact. Distinguish force, pressure and loaded area; spatial averaging by a pressure sensor also smooths small peaks.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「局部荷載與平均量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Local load versus mean flow\" is correct?","options":["平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。","越波平均量適合描述一段時間的水量，但堤後構件可能由短時局部衝擊控制。","長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels.","Mean overtopping describes water quantity over time, whereas a rear-side element may be governed by a brief localized impact.","Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar."],"answer":1,"explanation":"越波平均量適合描述一段時間的水量，但堤後構件可能由短時局部衝擊控制。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Mean overtopping describes water quantity over time, whereas a rear-side element may be governed by a brief localized impact. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b281-v15-38","title":"局部荷載與平均量：定量估算","titleEn":"Local load versus mean flow: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「局部荷載與平均量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Local load versus mean flow” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設均勻瞬時合力100N作用於0.020m²平板，p=F/A=5kPa；不代表其他面積或非均勻衝擊峰值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a uniform instantaneous100N resultant on a0.020m² plate. p=F/A=5kPa does not represent another area or a nonuniform impact peak. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設均勻瞬時合力100N作用於0.020m²平板，p=F/A=5kPa；不代表其他面積或非均勻衝擊峰值。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a uniform instantaneous100N resultant on a0.020m² plate. p=F/A=5kPa does not represent another area or a nonuniform impact peak.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「局部荷載與平均量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Local load versus mean flow\", which statement holds?","options":["收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。","相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.","Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b281-v15-39","title":"局部荷載與平均量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Local load versus mean flow: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「局部荷載與平均量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Local load versus mean flow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。保存感測面積、取樣頻率及載重方向，並檢查附屬構件的實際邊界是否與模型平板相同。另外積分時間歷程取得荷載衝量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor. Retain sensor area, sampling rate and load direction, checking whether the actual secondary element shares the model plate's support conditions. Integrate the force history separately to obtain impulse. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。保存感測面積、取樣頻率及載重方向，並檢查附屬構件的實際邊界是否與模型平板相同。","observationEn":"Site practice: Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor. Retain sensor area, sampling rate and load direction, checking whether the actual secondary element shares the model plate's support conditions.","failure":"注意干擾：小面積衝擊被平均到大面積後可能低估局部破壞，裝置自振又可能製造額外峰值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Averaging a small impact over a large area understates local damage, while rig vibration adds artificial peaks. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。保存感測面積、取樣頻率及載重方向，並檢查附屬構件的實際邊界是否與模型平板相同。另外積分時間歷程取得荷載衝量。","textEn":"Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor. Retain sensor area, sampling rate and load direction, checking whether the actual secondary element shares the model plate's support conditions. Integrate the force history separately to obtain impulse.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。保存感測面積、取樣頻率及載重方向，並檢查附屬構件的實際邊界是否與模型平板相同。","textEn":"Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor. Retain sensor area, sampling rate and load direction, checking whether the actual secondary element shares the model plate's support conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「局部荷載與平均量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Local load versus mean flow\"?","options":["以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。"],"optionsEn":["Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b281-v15-40","title":"局部荷載與平均量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Local load versus mean flow: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"prerequisiteIds":["b281-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「局部荷載與平均量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Local load versus mean flow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"小面積衝擊被平均到大面積後可能低估局部破壞，裝置自振又可能製造額外峰值。若只存最大數字而不存時間歷程，便無法分辨水力作用與儀器反應。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Averaging a small impact over a large area understates local damage, while rig vibration adds artificial peaks. Retaining only a maximum value prevents separation of the hydraulic event from the instrument response that followed it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：峰值持續時間決定荷載衝量，結構反應也受自身頻率與阻尼控制。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Peak duration controls load impulse, while the structural response additionally depends on its natural frequencies and damping.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b281-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"小面積衝擊被平均到大面積後可能低估局部破壞，裝置自振又可能製造額外峰值。若只存最大數字而不存時間歷程，便無法分辨水力作用與儀器反應。","textEn":"Averaging a small impact over a large area understates local damage, while rig vibration adds artificial peaks. Retaining only a maximum value prevents separation of the hydraulic event from the instrument response that followed it.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]},{"id":"b281-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「局部荷載與平均量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Local load versus mean flow\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","小面積衝擊被平均到大面積後可能低估局部破壞，裝置自振又可能製造額外峰值。","長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Averaging a small impact over a large area understates local damage, while rig vibration adds artificial peaks.","Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar."],"answer":1,"explanation":"小面積衝擊被平均到大面積後可能低估局部破壞，裝置自振又可能製造額外峰值。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Averaging a small impact over a large area understates local damage, while rig vibration adds artificial peaks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-eurotop","v15s-pwdm","v15s-cem","v15s-newbiggin","v15s-borth"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
